<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Tech Fusion Macro-Grid Executive Terminal</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 font-sans min-h-screen">

    <header class="border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/50 backdrop-blur px-6 py-4 flex justify-between items-center">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
            <div class="h-3 w-3 bg-emerald-500 rounded-full animate-pulse"></div>
            <h1 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-wider text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-400 to-cyan-400">
                TECH FUSION MACRO-GRID
            </h1>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-3 py-1 rounded text-slate-400 font-mono">
            STAGING_MODE // NO_DB_CONNECTED
        </span>
    </header>

    <main class="p-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-6">

        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            
            <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl space-y-3 shadow-xl">
                <div class="flex justify-between text-sm text-slate-400">
                    <span>Utility Grid Load</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt text-amber-400"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="text-3xl font-mono font-bold">2,450 <span class="text-lg text-slate-500">MW</span></div>
                <div class="w-full bg-slate-800 h-2 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="bg-amber-400 h-full w-[75%]"></div>
                </div>
                <span class="text-xs text-emerald-400 font-mono">● GRID OPTIMAL</span>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl space-y-3 shadow-xl">
                <div class="flex justify-between text-sm text-slate-400">
                    <span>U.S. 10Y Treasury Yield</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line text-cyan-400"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="text-3xl font-mono font-bold">4.63%</div>
                <div class="w-full bg-slate-800 h-2 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="bg-cyan-400 h-full w-[85%]"></div>
                </div>
                <span class="text-xs text-red-400 font-mono">▲ YIELD REGIME SHOCK TRIGGER</span>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl space-y-3 shadow-xl">
                <div class="flex justify-between text-sm text-slate-400">
                    <span>WTI Crude Oil</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-droplet text-emerald-400"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="text-3xl font-mono font-bold">$106.12 <span class="text-lg text-slate-500">/bbl</span></div>
                <div class="w-full bg-slate-800 h-2 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="bg-emerald-400 h-full w-[90%]"></div>
                </div>
                <span class="text-xs text-red-400 font-mono">▲ COMMODITY SHOCK PROFILE</span>
            </div>

        </section>

        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            
            <div class="lg:col-span-2 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col h-[400px]">
                <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-400 mb-4 font-mono flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-terminal text-emerald-400"></i> LIVE SYSTEM AUTOMATION LOGS
                </h3>
                <div class="flex-grow bg-slate-950 p-4 rounded-lg font-mono text-xs overflow-y-auto space-y-2 border border-slate-800 text-emerald-300">
                    <p class="text-slate-500">[2026-05-16 19:00:01] Ingress system initialization sequence triggered...</p>
                    <p class="text-slate-500">[2026-05-16 19:00:03] Bearer authorization token validation check: SUCCESS</p>
                    <p class="text-cyan-400">[2026-05-16 19:02:14] EVENT: 10Y Treasury crosses threshold boundary (>= 4.60%)</p>
                    <p class="text-amber-500">[2026-05-16 19:02:15] ACTION: SYSTEM_STATE -> MACRO_SHOCK. FinOps optimization rules activated.</p>
                    <p class="text-red-400">[2026-05-16 19:02:16] FAULT: Database payload save deferred. Target database pool is mock/unreachable.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6 space-y-4">
                <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-400 font-mono flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-wallet text-cyan-400"></i> MULTI-TENANT ESCROW WALLETS
                </h3>
                
                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <div class="p-3 bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg flex justify-between items-center">
                        <div>
                            <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-slate-300">ALPHA-QUANT-HEDGE</div>
                            <div class="text-xxs text-slate-500 font-mono">Scope3: 12.44 kg CO2</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-right">
                            <div class="text-sm font-mono font-bold text-emerald-400">$25.0M</div>
                            <span class="text-[10px] bg-cyan-950 border border-cyan-800 text-cyan-400 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">Cap: 4.60%</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="p-3 bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg flex justify-between items-center">
                        <div>
                            <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-slate-300">TEMA-PORT-AUTHORITY</div>
                            <div class="text-xxs text-slate-500 font-mono">Scope3: 45.85 kg CO2</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-right">
                            <div class="text-sm font-mono font-bold text-emerald-400">$125.0K</div>
                            <span class="text-[10px] bg-cyan-950 border border-cyan-800 text-cyan-400 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">Cap: 4.50%</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>

        </section>

    </main>

</body>
</html>
